  "notation": "Puc 802.11",
  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc800.html",
  "prefLabel": "Puc 802.11 Notification center",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 802.11 “Notification center” means the entity that performs the primary function of the system, is open to all operators within the state of New Hampshire, maintains a database of its members and operators and the specific geographic areas in which each of its members and operators desires to receive notice of proposed excavation, and which has the capability to transmit notices of proposed excavation to its members and operators by teletype, telecopy, personal computer, telephone, or other comparable means.\n\nSource. #7350, eff 8-23-00; ss by #7900, eff 5-29-03; ss and moved by #9318, eff 11-8-08 (from Puc 802.10); ss by #12102, eff 2-8-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc800.html"
